  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>兼容月报 | 生态突破 万里数据库携手15家伙伴筑牢数字生态基石</h2> <b>2025.12.05</b> <section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; visibility: visible; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(193, 35, 50); visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">生态共融，方能基业长青。</strong></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">2025年9-10月，万里数据库生态建设取得重要进展。我们与应用软件、安全、服务器/CPU、操作系统四大领域的15家生态伙伴完成兼容互认证，标志着国产化生态正从&quot;单点突破&quot;迈向&quot;系统推进&quot;的新阶段。这一系列合作成果，为各行业数字化转型提供了更完整、可靠的国产化解决方案。</span></p></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; bo